flowchart TD
    E[Rear E / focused captured / no UI modal or placement] --> Queue[One request / world model service camera identity]
    Queue --> Physics[Existing physics path / geometry synchronized]
    Physics --> Hit[First camera-reticle mask5 hit / no new reach rule]
    Hit -->|nonfacility or occluded| Reject[Existing hint / no selection or owner mutation]
    Hit --> Meta[Current collision-root ancestry / actual site ID]
    Meta --> Validate[Current request identities / actual Complete Workshop and owner]
    Validate -->|invalid removed replaced unsupported| Reject
    Validate --> Built[Constructed site / activities actual ID / kind site]
    Validate --> Initial[Declared initial-workshop / owner duty workshop / kind building]
    Built --> Visible[Validated target / make existing management visible]
    Initial --> Visible
    Visible --> Select[Existing BaseDemo select / current Work refresh and exact facility metadata]
    Select --> Verify[Verify same current owner and Work context]
    Verify -->|unavailable| Close[Close management / existing hint]
    Verify --> UI[Existing Work panel / released controls / selected region visible]
    UI --> Facts[Actual recipe target status local and missing inputs / present requested staff]
    UI --> Command[One existing UI target command / same actual production owner]
    Limits[No grants recipes rates staffing defaults haul orders or backend rewrite] -.-> Command
